# Cloudflare Pages redirects + SPA fallback.
# Syntax docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Order matters — specific rules first, SPA fallback LAST.
# CF Pages always serves real Pages Functions ahead of any redirect, so
# /api/ai → functions/api/ai.ts works without an explicit rule.

# Canonical: force www → apex. .pages.dev + .kineticgain.com aliases stay
# reachable as warm spares (same reasoning as the prior Netlify config).
https://www.sveska.studio/* https://sveska.studio/:splat 301!

# SPA fallback — every unmatched static path returns index.html so React
# Router can take over. 200 (rewrite) preserves the URL.
/* /index.html 200
